  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, hence <math><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the range of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math><math><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>A</mi></math></p>",
